abstract: "Prototipo académico open source para el monitoreo de adherencia institucional documentada a cinco prácticas de parto humanizado. The supporting research received prior approval from the Comité de Ética para la Investigación en Seres Humanos del Hospital General Docente de Calderón (CEISH-HGDC-2024-007; August 18, 2024). No individual-level research dataset is included in or distributed with this software release."
